<title>USA: Team Inc to sell Armstrong 650,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Team Inc to sell Armstrong 650,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>ALVIN, Texas 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Team Inc said Tuesday that it has signed a letter of intent to sell Armstrong International Inc 650,000 shares of Team's common stock for $3 per share in a private placement transaction.</p>
<p>Team also said it has agreed to provide specialized energy management and other industrial services to customers shared by the two companies.</p>
<p>Immediately following the stock sale, Armstrong would own about 10 percent of Team's shares on a fully diluted basis.</p>
</text>
